mmended Practice for Estimating Scratch Hardness of Coarse Aggregate Particles</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>COE CRD-C 143</RID><RTL>(1962) Specifications for Meters for Automatic Indication of Moisture in Fine Aggregate</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>COE CRD-C 400</RID><RTL>(1963) Requirements for Water for Use in Mixing or Curing Concrete</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Review submittal description (SD) definitions in Section <SRF>01 33 00</SRF> SUBMITTAL 
PROCEDURES and edit the following list, and corresponding submittal items in 
